  "Title": "Op-Amp Differentiator",
  "Description": "Operational amplifier practical differentiator circuit with dual split DC supply (+15V, -15V, middle GND reference), input differentiating capacitor Cin = 100 nF, series damping resistor Rs = 100 Ohm for high-frequency noise immunity, feedback resistor Rf = 10 kOhm (Vout = -Rf*Cin*dVin/dt), 0.0V DC steady state, and 10 kOhm load.",
